WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.333
AI-assisted creation in VectorPaint

2
00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:15.133
Close and fill the purple base; the palette tap is outside this close-up.

3
00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:24.400
Raise walls from the floor, then build the roof along consistent directions.

4
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:33.300
Build three blue roof panes; one open trial is rebuilt in the refinement chapter.

5
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:49.967
Close quadrilaterals, then fill blue: front glazing and three side panes.

6
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.867
