9
00:01:11.967 --> 00:01:24.467
Build closed pots and the lower door panel; position them later.

10
00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:39.467
Use larger triangles: three leaves per side are easier to close.

11
00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.300
One artwork, five authentic stages

12
00:01:44.633 --> 00:01:52.633
Open, partly open, closed: compare real layouts; Closed uses a compact landscape canvas.

13
00:01:52.633 --> 00:01:58.633
