14
00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.700
Real Device Hub pose samples

15
00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:17.133
Set Y in Geometry: left 695.67, right 706.87, to join pots and leaves.

16
00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:26.133
Fill the rebuilt roof pane blue, then inspect its four closed corner nodes.

17
00:02:26.133 --> 00:02:43.800
Place four white paving diamonds along the floor directions.

18
00:02:43.800 --> 00:03:02.800
